; exec_baseline — minimum SBPL needed for posix_spawn of a
; libSystem-dynamic helper to succeed under (deny default).
;
; Empirically derived against tests/suites/runner_use_c_worker/
; exec_fixture/helper.c on macOS 15 (Darwin 23.6.0).  See
; runner/augments/README.md for the authoring protocol and how to
; re-verify on a new macOS revision.
;
; Append-only / allow-only contract: callers opting into this
; augment via `policy.augments: ["exec_baseline"]` consent to having
; these operations allowed even if their own source denied them
; (SBPL is last-match-wins and augments are appended).

(allow process-exec*)
(allow process-fork)
(allow file-read*)
